WEBVTT

00:00:11.910 --> 00:00:14.030
Now, come at me!

00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:24.370
I'll take you on any time.

00:00:24.370 --> 00:00:27.800
That's the you I idolized.

00:02:19.700 --> 00:02:21.940
Hey, Shoji... What's up?

00:02:22.830 --> 00:02:24.990
What? Come to school?

00:02:26.500 --> 00:02:29.050
Oh! There's a fight?

00:02:35.750 --> 00:02:41.260
Well, let's see what the 6 
Holy Knights are made of.

00:02:56.230 --> 00:03:01.240
<b>No Conclusion Was Reached!</b>

00:03:04.960 --> 00:03:07.450
At first I simply looked up to you.

00:03:16.770 --> 00:03:18.630
All of you, grovel before me.

00:03:25.540 --> 00:03:26.980
Wait!

00:03:29.080 --> 00:03:34.460
Oga Tatsumi: At the time 13 years old, 
a first year at Katata Middle School.

00:03:42.180 --> 00:03:46.660
The nasty looks he gave kept getting 
him tangled up with the upperclassmen.

00:03:46.930 --> 00:03:49.160
And he returned the favor two-fold...

00:03:49.990 --> 00:03:52.820
The nickname they gave 
him: The Rampaging Ogre.

00:03:53.190 --> 00:03:58.170
At the time, his unbending will 
was so brilliant, it blinded me.

00:03:59.600 --> 00:04:00.920
You wanna get stronger?

00:04:00.920 --> 00:04:01.870
Yes!

00:04:02.960 --> 00:04:04.750
Don't even try, man!

00:04:04.750 --> 00:04:08.550
You ain't gonna get stronger 
by hangin' around this guy!

00:04:09.150 --> 00:04:11.840
Why, you ask? Just look at me!

00:04:12.340 --> 00:04:13.400
Don't brag about that.

00:04:13.690 --> 00:04:17.710
It's true that being together with 
him didn't make you stronger.

00:04:18.230 --> 00:04:22.630
Because no matter what fight you might get 
into, Oga Tatsumi would settle it by himself.

00:04:23.840 --> 00:04:26.200
Even so, I idolized him.

00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:29.860
Hoping for the day I could become 
strong enough to stand beside him.

00:04:32.430 --> 00:04:34.500
Until that incident...

00:04:53.100 --> 00:04:54.360
Oga!

00:04:59.050 --> 00:05:02.030
As I thought... You're using that technique.

00:05:02.790 --> 00:05:04.280
Move aside.

00:05:04.280 --> 00:05:08.550
That was merely a taste of my power.

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:12.790
This is a fight between me and him!

00:05:13.200 --> 00:05:16.710
That stance, and the blow from before...

00:05:16.710 --> 00:05:19.790
There's no mistaking it, 
he's using Hakkyokuken!

00:05:19.790 --> 00:05:24.010
It's a super-close-range martial 
art form that originated in China.

00:05:24.010 --> 00:05:27.240
It uses a special foot-planting 
power called "keiryoku",

00:05:27.240 --> 00:05:30.060
in order to push each punch 
to its utmost limit of power.

00:05:30.420 --> 00:05:34.300
It's even said to be used 
by the Chinese military.

00:05:34.980 --> 00:05:39.440
But, why is it...? I feel like 
there's something more...

00:05:44.340 --> 00:05:46.070
H-Hey!

00:05:50.250 --> 00:05:52.290
It'll be fine. Believe in him.

00:05:53.930 --> 00:05:57.390
That's right. It doesn't matter 
what martial arts he's facing.

00:05:57.390 --> 00:05:58.460
He isn't going to lose.

00:05:59.780 --> 00:06:02.590
Sorry about getting in the way.

00:06:03.580 --> 00:06:05.030
Please continue.

00:06:08.720 --> 00:06:11.310
Seems you're pretty trusted.

00:06:11.560 --> 00:06:12.620
I'm jealous.

00:06:15.250 --> 00:06:20.620
Well, I'll continue, but all that's 
left is the finishing blow.

00:06:21.010 --> 00:06:24.980
Perhaps it's really those two over 
there who you should worry about.

00:06:27.570 --> 00:06:31.700
What's wrong? Can't keep it up, can you?

00:06:35.700 --> 00:06:37.100
Lol.

00:06:37.100 --> 00:06:38.710
But, that's...

00:06:38.710 --> 00:06:43.210
Oga, this fight has been unsatisfying.

00:06:50.040 --> 00:06:50.720
It's over!

00:06:59.770 --> 00:07:00.980
You're...

00:07:06.300 --> 00:07:10.740
What?! You didn't mean <i>this</i> school?

00:07:12.140 --> 00:07:13.750
Give me a heads up or something!

00:07:18.250 --> 00:07:21.920
Yo... Looks like you people are livin' it up.

00:07:21.920 --> 00:07:23.380
Kanzaki!

00:07:23.380 --> 00:07:24.990
Kanzaki-san...

00:07:24.990 --> 00:07:26.380
He's alive?

00:07:26.380 --> 00:07:28.380
Don't go killing him off!

00:07:29.760 --> 00:07:31.380
Tenacious bastard...

00:07:31.380 --> 00:07:33.220
Stand up, you.

00:07:33.690 --> 00:07:36.010
Our fight ain't over yet.

00:07:39.230 --> 00:07:41.350
Hey, your grip is loose.

00:07:49.360 --> 00:07:53.740
My, my... Although it's not 
my style to fight for real...

00:07:57.340 --> 00:08:00.680
Hey, what's wrong? You scared?

00:08:01.580 --> 00:08:04.380
Get on with it and come at me!

00:08:04.380 --> 00:08:07.000
I'll punch you all the way out to Saturn!

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:07.880
Outta the way!

00:08:13.340 --> 00:08:15.330
He punched him!

00:08:23.970 --> 00:08:25.860
O-Oga-chan?

00:08:25.860 --> 00:08:27.150
How cruel...

00:08:27.660 --> 00:08:28.650
Is he a demon?

00:08:29.900 --> 00:08:31.240
That was cruel of him.

00:08:32.180 --> 00:08:36.740
Sorry, but this is my fight now.

00:08:36.740 --> 00:08:37.970
Oga!

00:08:42.850 --> 00:08:44.580
It was the right decision.

00:08:45.040 --> 00:08:47.500
He is no longer in any shape to fight.

00:08:47.500 --> 00:08:50.780
If he went any further, I wouldn't 
be able to guarantee he would live.

00:08:51.290 --> 00:08:52.260
Isn't that right?

00:08:54.010 --> 00:08:58.290
Oga, could that be the 
reason you punched him out?

00:08:58.290 --> 00:09:01.020
In order to prevent Kanzaki 
and Miki from fighting...

00:09:01.020 --> 00:09:04.020
No, not at all. He was just in the way.

00:09:08.230 --> 00:09:10.850
People sure go flying a lot...

00:09:11.180 --> 00:09:13.580
Don't tell me... You're laughing?

00:09:13.580 --> 00:09:14.670
N-No...

00:09:16.530 --> 00:09:19.850
The way you talk really pisses me off.

00:09:19.850 --> 00:09:24.040
Is it just you being contrary, or is 
that really who you are? Either way.

00:09:24.040 --> 00:09:26.910
That's the way you push away your friends.

00:09:26.910 --> 00:09:30.540
You step on people's trust 
like it was nothing!

00:09:32.550 --> 00:09:37.570
I've got a special move I've 
been saving up too, you know.

00:09:38.060 --> 00:09:39.400
Special move?

00:09:39.670 --> 00:09:41.750
Furuichi-san, we're in trouble!

00:09:41.750 --> 00:09:45.580
Brother might be thinking of 
using his 800 volt attack!

00:09:46.280 --> 00:09:47.840
Trying to provoke me?

00:09:47.840 --> 00:09:51.570
Foolishness... I can see through you, Oga!

00:09:52.440 --> 00:09:54.440
He's coming in with a real attack!

00:09:54.700 --> 00:09:58.950
Special attack... Burying Punch!

00:09:59.740 --> 00:10:01.870
It's his usual punch!

00:10:01.870 --> 00:10:04.300
Punch! Punch! Punch!

00:10:04.540 --> 00:10:05.580
Punch!

00:10:05.580 --> 00:10:08.300
Burying Kick!

00:10:11.070 --> 00:10:13.900
Is that his secret move?

00:10:17.120 --> 00:10:18.650
Let me explain.

00:10:19.400 --> 00:10:24.200
The "Burying Punch" unquestionably buries 
whoever is hit by it into a wall!

00:10:21.930 --> 00:10:31.060
<b>Burying Punch!!</b>

00:10:24.200 --> 00:10:27.230
It's an incredibly violent Demon technique!

00:10:27.230 --> 00:10:28.910
That's my Brother!

00:10:28.910 --> 00:10:30.770
The Burying Kick is just the same!

00:10:31.060 --> 00:10:32.060
<b>Burying Kick!!</b>

00:10:32.420 --> 00:10:33.950
Smashing Upper!

00:10:34.320 --> 00:10:36.570
Bite the Dust Head Butt!

00:10:36.570 --> 00:10:38.750
This Ain't Funny Anymore Chop!

00:10:38.750 --> 00:10:40.570
That doesn't count as a chop!

00:10:42.660 --> 00:10:46.080
Foolishness. You call those special moves?

00:10:48.980 --> 00:10:52.310
I tire of your silly sideshow.

00:10:54.960 --> 00:11:00.030
I'll show you what a real special attack is.

00:11:22.090 --> 00:11:24.490
What?! The atmosphere's totally changed.

00:11:26.490 --> 00:11:28.590
I'll tell you this ahead of time...

00:11:29.100 --> 00:11:32.040
I can't hold back with this technique.

00:11:32.040 --> 00:11:35.410
If it hits, even you won't escape unhurt.

00:11:35.890 --> 00:11:38.510
So you'd better make sure to dodge it!

00:11:38.510 --> 00:11:40.420
Oga, watch out! Run for it!

00:11:43.530 --> 00:11:44.820
That's far enough.

00:11:45.620 --> 00:11:50.220
You mustn't, remember? That 
technique is banned by Izuma-kun.

00:11:50.220 --> 00:11:52.730
N-Nanami-senpai!

00:11:53.580 --> 00:11:55.610
When did she...?

00:11:56.070 --> 00:11:58.080
I didn't feel her presence.

00:11:58.970 --> 00:12:01.430
And the rest of you, stop 
this foolish fighting.

00:12:02.340 --> 00:12:06.580
Going off on your own... Did you think 
by keeping quiet we wouldn't notice?

00:12:07.260 --> 00:12:10.890
He's <i>quite</i> angry.

00:12:31.020 --> 00:12:34.190
Don't worry! I ain't angry.

00:12:35.210 --> 00:12:36.400
Izuma-san!

00:12:36.650 --> 00:12:40.580
Okay then, just let me through here...

00:12:43.500 --> 00:12:46.410
Is he one of the 6 Holy Knights,Yamamura-kun?

00:12:46.990 --> 00:12:51.320
It's over. Now that he's 
here, the fight can't go on.

00:12:52.190 --> 00:12:57.670
That's Izuma Kaname, Miki's master and 
the strongest of the 6 Holy Knights!

00:13:00.030 --> 00:13:04.350
I-I'm sorry, Izuma-san... I...

00:13:05.060 --> 00:13:07.280
Even Miki here is cowering...

00:13:09.550 --> 00:13:13.550
Not just Miki, but all the 6 Holy 
Knights are acting like little children

00:13:13.550 --> 00:13:15.690
who've been caught playing pranks.

00:13:16.390 --> 00:13:18.430
I told you though, I ain't mad.

00:13:19.130 --> 00:13:22.690
There's no mistaking it, he's 
the strongest at St. Ishiyama!

00:13:23.010 --> 00:13:25.970
What'll you do? We're at a 
clear disadvantage here...

00:13:25.970 --> 00:13:27.310
Now would be the time to escape...

00:13:27.930 --> 00:13:32.200
Hey now, Kunieda! Don't be 
makin' such a pitiful face!

00:13:34.580 --> 00:13:37.420
Looks like you guys are havin' a fun time.

00:13:37.880 --> 00:13:39.710
Cut me in.

00:13:39.710 --> 00:13:41.130
Tojo!

00:13:43.050 --> 00:13:46.730
So which will be the one to play with me?

00:13:47.120 --> 00:13:48.340
You?

00:13:48.960 --> 00:13:50.270
Or you?

00:13:50.570 --> 00:13:53.130
Or maybe you?

00:13:53.130 --> 00:13:56.140
Uh... What's the point of fighting Oga-chan?

00:13:56.140 --> 00:13:57.750
Oh, right.

00:13:58.230 --> 00:14:02.900
Well, there's also just beating 
up the whole lot of you.

00:14:04.810 --> 00:14:05.980
Hold it.

00:14:06.850 --> 00:14:09.950
Sorry, but that's enough 
children's games for now.

00:14:10.580 --> 00:14:13.620
Can't have this, now. This won't do at all!

00:14:15.190 --> 00:14:17.130
So you're the boss?

00:14:17.810 --> 00:14:19.100
Here I come!

00:14:21.210 --> 00:14:22.540
Izuma-san!

00:14:23.270 --> 00:14:25.110
Ooh, you're scary.

00:14:29.400 --> 00:14:31.930
He stopped Tojo's punch!

00:14:33.180 --> 00:14:34.430
Why, you...

00:14:35.260 --> 00:14:36.180
Hey, wait...

00:14:36.270 --> 00:14:37.730
Crushing Fist!

00:14:39.690 --> 00:14:42.440
That's what Oga got hit with before!

00:14:42.440 --> 00:14:43.670
Tojo!

00:14:47.800 --> 00:14:49.340
That hurt.

00:14:50.680 --> 00:14:52.690
It didn't work at all...

00:14:53.120 --> 00:14:54.450
You've gotta be kidding me...

00:15:00.460 --> 00:15:04.470
Sheesh... Everyone's out for blood today.

00:15:04.750 --> 00:15:08.970
I'm shocked. Taking a blow 
from Hisaya like it's nothing?

00:15:08.970 --> 00:15:12.730
You're one of those natural 
fighters, aren't you?

00:15:14.380 --> 00:15:16.490
Finally deciding to put up a fight?

00:15:17.440 --> 00:15:18.980
Well, you see...

00:15:19.240 --> 00:15:22.760
If you want a fight, I'll have a 
match (shiai) with you any time.

00:15:23.110 --> 00:15:27.000
But "shi" in shiai as in 
"shi" in shinin (dead man).

00:15:37.240 --> 00:15:38.500
What?

00:15:38.500 --> 00:15:43.500
Just for a second, I felt like there 
was a strong wind centered around him.

00:15:44.000 --> 00:15:47.920
Oh, oops! Looks like I'm 
getting carried away here.

00:15:48.320 --> 00:15:50.420
Shizuka-san, please clean up here.

00:15:50.670 --> 00:15:54.340
Yes... Okay everyone, call it quits.

00:15:54.340 --> 00:15:57.260
Go-kun, Sakaki-kun, carry Alex-kun for us.

00:15:57.810 --> 00:16:01.540
Miki-kun, stop standing 
at the ready and let's go.

00:16:01.800 --> 00:16:02.520
Right!

00:16:03.320 --> 00:16:07.030
Yamamura-kun, just wondering, 
but who is the beautiful lady?

00:16:07.030 --> 00:16:09.460
The third year, Nanami Shizuka.

00:16:09.460 --> 00:16:10.530
Who's that?

00:16:10.530 --> 00:16:12.570
Her nickname is Lady Shizuka.

00:16:12.570 --> 00:16:16.530
The only female in the 6 Holy Knights, 
and the captain of the Archery Club!

00:16:16.530 --> 00:16:19.090
Archery? That's nice...

00:16:19.090 --> 00:16:20.790
Pretty sexy...

00:16:25.850 --> 00:16:27.460
Hold it!

00:16:27.460 --> 00:16:29.350
Don't just end it.

00:16:29.350 --> 00:16:32.320
You runnin' away? We haven't finished here.

00:16:34.920 --> 00:16:37.290
No, it's quite over.

00:16:37.290 --> 00:16:41.310
Well, the police can keep 
you company, if you'd like.

00:16:44.210 --> 00:16:48.260
Of course, we have no intention 
of leaving things like this.

00:16:48.940 --> 00:16:55.820
I will carefully consider some way to 
resolve our conflict without leaving grudges.

00:16:55.820 --> 00:17:00.780
Oga... Next time. Next time I'll crush you.

00:17:00.780 --> 00:17:02.830
Get lost, idiot.

00:17:05.800 --> 00:17:09.900
And like that, the day 
ended with no resolution.

00:17:18.480 --> 00:17:22.570
"Due to delinquent behavior 
and destruction of property,

00:17:22.570 --> 00:17:25.890
the following students are expelled:

00:17:25.890 --> 00:17:27.190
Oga Tatsumi.

00:17:27.190 --> 00:17:29.000
Kunieda Aoi.

00:17:29.000 --> 00:17:30.250
Tojo Hidetora.

00:17:30.250 --> 00:17:31.570
Kanzaki Hajime.

00:17:31.570 --> 00:17:32.950
Himekawa Tatsuya.

00:17:32.950 --> 00:17:34.670
Natsume Shintaro...

00:17:35.490 --> 00:17:37.830
Furuichi Takayuki...

00:17:37.600 --> 00:17:38.990
<b>*shock*</b>

00:17:38.990 --> 00:17:40.740
<b>Counselor's Office</b>

00:17:45.750 --> 00:17:48.680
Of course, our school's students 
are also in the wrong.

00:17:48.680 --> 00:17:50.340
I recognize that.

00:17:50.340 --> 00:17:54.740
But you committed these crimes 
even after considerable warning.

00:17:54.740 --> 00:17:56.760
Do you have something to say?

00:17:59.520 --> 00:18:01.600
I don't want to hear what <i>you</i> have to say.

00:18:01.600 --> 00:18:03.270
Nor could I understand it.

00:18:04.690 --> 00:18:08.270
Um... But I didn't do anything?

00:18:08.270 --> 00:18:10.230
Playing dumb isn't going to help.

00:18:10.230 --> 00:18:13.780
You, the Strategist, must have 
helped with your intelligence, yes?

00:18:14.840 --> 00:18:16.710
No!

00:18:16.710 --> 00:18:20.110
Wait! He's really not involved!

00:18:20.110 --> 00:18:21.780
Kunieda-senpai!

00:18:21.780 --> 00:18:27.290
Or rather, all responsibility lies with 
me since I was unable to stop them.

00:18:27.600 --> 00:18:31.550
If I must be expelled, so be it.

00:18:31.550 --> 00:18:37.800
But the rest of the people here should receive 
the same punishment as the St. Ishiyama students!

00:18:40.050 --> 00:18:46.460
So you know, the students of ours that are 
being punished are the two who hurt Shiroyama,

00:18:46.930 --> 00:18:49.560
Each of them are suspended for 2 weeks.

00:18:49.980 --> 00:18:53.190
The 6 Holy Knights are not being punished.

00:18:53.190 --> 00:18:56.200
Hey now... What's with that?

00:18:56.570 --> 00:19:00.260
Too bad for you, their position and 
yours are completely different.

00:19:00.510 --> 00:19:05.610
They are allowed to carry out limited 
disciplinary actions in order to uphold school order.

00:19:05.610 --> 00:19:08.200
The incident this time 
falls under that category.

00:19:08.200 --> 00:19:10.210
They are not in error.

00:19:10.210 --> 00:19:12.460
I cannot accept that!

00:19:12.460 --> 00:19:14.610
Looks like talking isn't getting anywhere.

00:19:14.900 --> 00:19:19.300
So you're saying we should shut 
up and take it lying down?

00:19:19.870 --> 00:19:22.550
You two, say something here!

00:19:24.020 --> 00:19:27.560
Anyway, I came to fight the guy with glasses.

00:19:27.800 --> 00:19:29.830
And I gotta give that guy a good beating...

00:19:33.330 --> 00:19:36.940
Are you even listening? You're going 
to be expelled! Do you understand?

00:19:36.940 --> 00:19:39.080
Well, what can we do?

00:19:39.080 --> 00:19:40.940
It's already been decided, right?

00:19:40.940 --> 00:19:43.820
What can you do? You can fight back a little!

00:19:43.820 --> 00:19:47.450
No, they actually have a point.

00:19:47.820 --> 00:19:53.790
If we're gonna be expelled anyway, I'd 
rather it be after finishing those guys off.

00:19:53.830 --> 00:19:54.940
Later.

00:19:54.940 --> 00:19:55.930
Later.

00:19:55.930 --> 00:19:56.510
Later.

00:19:56.510 --> 00:19:57.340
Everyone!

00:19:57.920 --> 00:19:59.410
Hold it.

00:20:00.140 --> 00:20:01.860
Then, let's do this.

00:20:02.090 --> 00:20:06.470
In one month, we will hold a school festival.

00:20:06.470 --> 00:20:11.100
There, you seven and the 6 Holy 
Knights can finish things.

00:20:12.500 --> 00:20:15.840
But through sports, not fighting.

00:20:15.840 --> 00:20:17.300
"School festival"-like.

00:20:17.300 --> 00:20:18.480
Sports?

00:20:18.750 --> 00:20:22.470
Yes. As one of the School Festival events.

00:20:22.810 --> 00:20:27.490
I'll make sure that the contest doesn't 
favor any of the 6 Holy Knights.

00:20:27.490 --> 00:20:33.600
And if you happen to win, I'll 
reconsider your punishment.

00:20:33.600 --> 00:20:35.750
Your expulsion will be postponed until then.

00:20:38.760 --> 00:20:42.380
So? I think it's quite a nice offer.

00:20:42.380 --> 00:20:44.790
No, not yet.

00:20:44.790 --> 00:20:47.550
There's no risk to them otherwise.

00:20:47.550 --> 00:20:52.890
If we win, the 6 Holy Knights 
should lose their authority!

00:20:56.400 --> 00:20:57.600
Fine, then.

00:20:57.890 --> 00:21:04.280
But regardless of the outcome, you must 
swear never to cause trouble again.

00:21:04.280 --> 00:21:05.680
Of course!

00:21:08.430 --> 00:21:10.400
And that's how it's done.

00:21:10.660 --> 00:21:14.680
Excellent, Hime-chan. You're 
great at negotiations.

00:21:15.500 --> 00:21:18.180
Got away by the skin of our teeth...

00:21:18.730 --> 00:21:22.260
So... Can we go beat them up now?

00:21:22.260 --> 00:21:23.700
No, you can't!

00:21:23.700 --> 00:21:25.180
Did you even hear a damn thing?!

00:21:26.810 --> 00:21:28.310
My head hurts...

00:23:04.110 --> 00:23:06.150
So, will that do?

00:23:06.950 --> 00:23:10.160
Yes, thank you.

00:23:13.610 --> 00:23:19.910
This way they'll be serious, and it'll 
provide a fitting stage for Hisaya and the others.

00:23:20.170 --> 00:23:25.920
Sorry about putting your authority 
on the line like that.

00:23:25.920 --> 00:23:28.420
Oh, no... I don't mind.

00:23:39.380 --> 00:23:41.350
Since I won't lose.

00:24:02.500 --> 00:24:05.420
Well we escaped expulsion 
for now, but what'll we do?

00:24:05.420 --> 00:24:07.800
Deciding things with sports? 
What's that supposed to mean?

00:24:07.800 --> 00:24:10.170
Looks like the event's been decided.

00:24:10.170 --> 00:24:12.060
I can't believe it... It's <i>that</i>...

00:24:12.300 --> 00:24:15.300
Judo? Karate? Or the always 
unexpected synchronized swimming?!

00:24:15.580 --> 00:24:17.950
And a new development coming in like a storm!

00:24:17.950 --> 00:24:20.810
A ringer transfer student 
comes into our class!

00:24:20.810 --> 00:24:22.410
On the next Beelzebub:

00:24:22.410 --> 00:24:24.860
What Has the Transfer Girl Done?

00:24:24.860 --> 00:24:27.620
No matter what it is, it'll 
be fine as long as I'm here...

00:24:27.620 --> 00:24:28.690
Worry not.

00:24:27.940 --> 00:24:28.690
Shut up.
